(4840343, 701280, 73056, '<td valign="top">Peter Gabriel''s song Steam was the first thing that popped up in my mind because I thought that would be the perfect title. Second thing was nice conversion and shot.</td>', 'Peter Gabriel''s song Steam was the first thing that popped up in my mind because I thought that would be the perfect title. Second thing was nice conversion and shot.', '2008-07-23 03:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
