(4840546, 701475, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love te lighting and color... the darks/blacks give it a richness and make it different than other images of this type. I''m not sure why it''s rotated. I find my self tilting my head to look at it. I think I''d like it better horizontal. Nicely done.</td>', 'I love te lighting and color... the darks/blacks give it a richness and make it different than other images of this type. I''m not sure why it''s rotated. I find my self tilting my head to look at it. I think I''d like it better horizontal. Nicely done.', '2008-07-23 07:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
