(4844903, 701553, 60173, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I''m saying this...<br/> <br/>More cleavage... Something about the cleavage being cut off there makes me want to push the left edge of the frame aside. I think the crop is just too tight. <br/> <br/>I like the overall colors and the smoke, but it got me wondering how people get their smoke to be whiter. Yours is a bit gray. I''m sure you can adjust it using Selective Color and adjusting the grays, but in basic you''d probably screw up a bunch of other colors. Even in advanced it would be hard. Hmmm</td>', 'I can''t believe I''m saying this... More cleavage... Something about the cleavage being cut off there makes me want to push the left edge of the frame aside. I think the crop is just too tight.  I like the overall colors and the smoke, but it got me wondering how people get their smoke to be whiter. Yours is a bit gray. I''m sure you can adjust it using Selective Color and adjusting the grays, but in basic you''d probably screw up a bunch of other colors. Even in advanced it would be hard. Hmmm', '2008-07-25 16:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
