(4848203, 700158, 58691, '<td valign="top">This image is very dramatic in its simplicity. The electric burners are very recognizable to just about everyone and an object many see everyday. This high-contrast representation certainly portrays Hot. The balanced composition leaves me with the feeling that this is one segment, the lower right corner, of a four panel poster that together would complete the circle(s). A bulls eye!</td>', 'This image is very dramatic in its simplicity. The electric burners are very recognizable to just about everyone and an object many see everyday. This high-contrast representation certainly portrays Hot. The balanced composition leaves me with the feeling that this is one segment, the lower right corner, of a four panel poster that together would complete the circle(s). A bulls eye!', '2008-07-28 17:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848205, 702212, 57229, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what that thing is, although the title and graphic are telling me there''s something piquant there and maybe it''s familiar to enough people to ring bells. I like what I see of the idea, but I feel no heat.</td>', 'I don''t know what that thing is, although the title and graphic are telling me there''s something piquant there and maybe it''s familiar to enough people to ring bells. I like what I see of the idea, but I feel no heat.', '2008-07-28 17:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848207, 702215, 57229, '<td valign="top">That''s hot. The flame''s pretty overwhelming (in compositional terms, I mean), but it''s exciting, so...</td>', 'That''s hot. The flame''s pretty overwhelming (in compositional terms, I mean), but it''s exciting, so...', '2008-07-28 17:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848209, 702079, 57229, '<td valign="top">That looks real. The flash is a bit iffy, what with the flat/hard lighting, but maybe that was the one thing it needed to make it happen. I think it''s a brave shot, because this could so easily have looked like someone who just stepped out of the shower and made a face, but it works (for me) - bravo.</td>', 'That looks real. The flash is a bit iffy, what with the flat/hard lighting, but maybe that was the one thing it needed to make it happen. I think it''s a brave shot, because this could so easily have looked like someone who just stepped out of the shower and made a face, but it works (for me) - bravo.', '2008-07-28 17:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848212, 701919, 57229, '<td valign="top">Some think outside the box and some take the box for a space-walk...</td>', 'Some think outside the box and some take the box for a space-walk...', '2008-07-28 17:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848223, 702220, 57229, '<td valign="top">Took a while to see what this is. Fly-by voters may miss it :-) It''d be worth practicing this to get a clearer effect - don''t get burned now...</td>', 'Took a while to see what this is. Fly-by voters may miss it :-) It''d be worth practicing this to get a clearer effect - don''t get burned now...', '2008-07-28 17:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848226, 701491, 57229, '<td valign="top">This had to happen. Good shot.</td>', 'This had to happen. Good shot.', '2008-07-28 17:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848229, 702187, 57229, '<td valign="top">Oy, veh - that''s so hot it''s developed emotions...</td>', 'Oy, veh - that''s so hot it''s developed emotions...', '2008-07-28 17:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848233, 700069, 57229, '<td valign="top">Certainly beautiful, less certainly hot - there''s a sort of pastel coolness to the lemon wash...</td>', 'Certainly beautiful, less certainly hot - there''s a sort of pastel coolness to the lemon wash...', '2008-07-28 17:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848236, 701471, 57229, '<td valign="top">I wish she looked happier about it.</td>', 'I wish she looked happier about it.', '2008-07-28 17:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848246, 701365, 57229, '<td valign="top">This is a neat and striking picture, but it so strives to be literary/tell a story that I need it to make sense. My bad.</td>', 'This is a neat and striking picture, but it so strives to be literary/tell a story that I need it to make sense. My bad.', '2008-07-28 17:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848250, 702210, 57229, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture - lacks  the impression of heat, for me, but I do like the  lines/comp. etc.</td>', 'Lovely picture - lacks  the impression of heat, for me, but I do like the  lines/comp. etc.', '2008-07-28 17:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848256, 701700, 57229, '<td valign="top">Fine picture - a step of thinking or analysis away from the idea or impression of heat though.</td>', 'Fine picture - a step of thinking or analysis away from the idea or impression of heat though.', '2008-07-28 17:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848259, 702012, 57229, '<td valign="top">K.I.S.S. well done.</td>', 'K.I.S.S. well done.', '2008-07-28 17:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848326, 701475, 57229, '<td valign="top">Strange rotation - actually an interesting picture (ie one that grabs my interest) but I think it suffers in the end from telling hot but not showing it. It was never going to be easy.</td>', 'Strange rotation - actually an interesting picture (ie one that grabs my interest) but I think it suffers in the end from telling hot but not showing it. It was never going to be easy.', '2008-07-28 18:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848329, 701855, 57229, '<td valign="top">I mistrust pastel shades for the impression of heat, but this has the hue and does surprisingly well - it''s like a prologue to heat.</td>', 'I mistrust pastel shades for the impression of heat, but this has the hue and does surprisingly well - it''s like a prologue to heat.', '2008-07-28 18:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848330, 699787, 57229, '<td valign="top">A smile for the subtle phrase of the title...</td>', 'A smile for the subtle phrase of the title...', '2008-07-28 18:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848336, 701141, 57229, '<td valign="top">Hot colours, but the scene has cool elements (sea and onshore breeze)...</td>', 'Hot colours, but the scene has cool elements (sea and onshore breeze)...', '2008-07-28 18:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848339, 702066, 57229, '<td valign="top">Visions like this could lead to steam engines, industrial revolutions . . .<br/>needs the fire, or something for visual heat...</td>', 'Visions like this could lead to steam engines, industrial revolutions . . .needs the fire, or something for visual heat...', '2008-07-28 18:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848340, 701556, 57229, '<td valign="top">A play on words, but I like the game...</td>', 'A play on words, but I like the game...', '2008-07-28 18:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848421, 700158, 71409, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Very simple idea... very cool :) er, HOT image.</td>', 'I like it.  Very simple idea... very cool :) er, HOT image.', '2008-07-28 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848422, 700239, 71409, '<td valign="top">neat idea, too blurry though.</td>', 'neat idea, too blurry though.', '2008-07-28 19:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848423, 701592, 71409, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Very simple.  The off centered flame creates an interesting tension in the image.</td>', 'I like it.  Very simple.  The off centered flame creates an interesting tension in the image.', '2008-07-28 19:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848426, 701773, 71409, '<td valign="top">wish it were more contrast-e</td>', 'wish it were more contrast-e', '2008-07-28 19:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848430, 700525, 71409, '<td valign="top">That says hot.  only critique would be the white showing in the upper left, and overall maybe a little more contrasty.</td>', 'That says hot.  only critique would be the white showing in the upper left, and overall maybe a little more contrasty.', '2008-07-28 19:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848431, 702212, 71409, '<td valign="top">:) took me a minute to figure out the shadow is a flame... neat idea</td>', ':) took me a minute to figure out the shadow is a flame... neat idea', '2008-07-28 19:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848436, 701758, 71409, '<td valign="top">I like the good sharp image and lighting... not sure about that little flare to the right of the pepper.</td>', 'I like the good sharp image and lighting... not sure about that little flare to the right of the pepper.', '2008-07-28 19:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848439, 700736, 71409, '<td valign="top">lol - make the hot even hotter. I like the image - nice and sharp and good colors/contrast.</td>', 'lol - make the hot even hotter. I like the image - nice and sharp and good colors/contrast.', '2008-07-28 19:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848443, 701855, 71409, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image... very dreamy... not sure that it really says "HOT" though... although if it were maybe a tad sharper i''d say it''d be a real nice postcard/calendar image.</td>', 'This is a nice image... very dreamy... not sure that it really says "HOT" though... although if it were maybe a tad sharper i''d say it''d be a real nice postcard/calendar image.', '2008-07-28 19:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4848444, 701699, 71409, '<td valign="top">:) how many shots did that take?</td>', ':) how many shots did that take?', '2008-07-28 19:36:14.000000', NULL, 1);
