(4849043, 701096, 14437, '<td valign="top">Wow. I don''t know how you did this but it''s very beautiful.</td>', 'Wow. I don''t know how you did this but it''s very beautiful.', '2008-07-29 04:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849471, 700858, 15335, '<td valign="top">I think this is the meaning of HOT</td>', 'I think this is the meaning of HOT', '2008-07-29 13:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849498, 701463, 90387, '<td valign="top">What an excellent shot!  Perfectly clear and crisp, especially for something moving so fast.</td>', 'What an excellent shot!  Perfectly clear and crisp, especially for something moving so fast.', '2008-07-29 14:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849502, 700337, 90387, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see how you pulled this off in basic.  Outstanding!</td>', 'I can''t wait to see how you pulled this off in basic.  Outstanding!', '2008-07-29 14:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849630, 701225, 5585, '<td valign="top">LoL...I needed that...</td>', 'LoL...I needed that...', '2008-07-29 15:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849678, 699978, 94931, '<td valign="top">Could be sharper, and the background at the top left is unappealing.</td>', 'Could be sharper, and the background at the top left is unappealing.', '2008-07-29 16:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849721, 701735, 8860, '<td valign="top">Striking shot (probably the winning one) with a great sky. The silhouette is a little indistinct in places but I like the horse stance.<br/> <br/>It''s just a big shame that it''s so sharpened that it''s created a distracting halo, although it''s possibly intentional. You need to be careful with your border too (see bottom edges). <br/> <br/>Personally, I''d prefer it much less extreme as it would add so much more gravitas to the photo.</td>', 'Striking shot (probably the winning one) with a great sky. The silhouette is a little indistinct in places but I like the horse stance. It''s just a big shame that it''s so sharpened that it''s created a distracting halo, although it''s possibly intentional. You need to be careful with your border too (see bottom edges).  Personally, I''d prefer it much less extreme as it would add so much more gravitas to the photo.', '2008-07-29 17:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849723, 701182, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great cloud, if a little too distant in terms of challenge theme.</td>', 'Great cloud, if a little too distant in terms of challenge theme.', '2008-07-29 17:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849743, 700239, 86799, '<td valign="top">This would be way better sharper and not so overexposed on the burner.</td>', 'This would be way better sharper and not so overexposed on the burner.', '2008-07-29 17:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849747, 701559, 86799, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Very cool.  One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2008-07-29 17:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849861, 700865, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice action - could do with being straightened. <br/> <br/>I like the little tendrils of light after the sparks. It would perhaps be more involving if we were closer to the thing being welded so that we could identify it, as much of the lower portion of your frame is irrelevant. A rectangular crop mid way through the shot would make it stronger in my view.</td>', 'Nice action - could do with being straightened.  I like the little tendrils of light after the sparks. It would perhaps be more involving if we were closer to the thing being welded so that we could identify it, as much of the lower portion of your frame is irrelevant. A rectangular crop mid way through the shot would make it stronger in my view.', '2008-07-29 19:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4849910, 702107, 95101, '<td valign="top">Whoa , now thats hot;)</td>', 'Whoa , now thats hot;)', '2008-07-29 20:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4850107, 700547, 24896, '<td valign="top">Other then a couple of really blown out highlights this shot is a perfect entry. Funny, creative, sexy, and totally original. You have my vote 10. Best of luck Scott</td>', 'Other then a couple of really blown out highlights this shot is a perfect entry. Funny, creative, sexy, and totally original. You have my vote 10. Best of luck Scott', '2008-07-29 22:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4850127, 702039, 24896, '<td valign="top">OK this photo really does not have a lot going for it. First it is really flat. The banks flower logo is cut in half, the bricks on the bottom right really don''t add anything to the capture. Its been taken from a slight angle but not significant enough to look intentional or purposeful. And the crop isn''t centered. True that the sign reads 99degs and that''s hot, but this pic just isn''t. This was my lowest rated photo for the hot challenge "4" because it is in focus and hot can be seen in the photo without having to read the title. If you where going for Brown or trying to sabotage your score for the better then average side challenge you have succeeded. If not and you have questions or comments please PM me. Scott</td>', 'OK this photo really does not have a lot going for it. First it is really flat. The banks flower logo is cut in half, the bricks on the bottom right really don''t add anything to the capture. Its been taken from a slight angle but not significant enough to look intentional or purposeful. And the crop isn''t centered. True that the sign reads 99degs and that''s hot, but this pic just isn''t. This was my lowest rated photo for the hot challenge "4" because it is in focus and hot can be seen in the photo without having to read the title. If you where going for Brown or trying to sabotage your score for the better then average side challenge you have succeeded. If not and you have questions or comments please PM me. Scott', '2008-07-29 22:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4850135, 700858, 24896, '<td valign="top">Hooker heals and hot pink what a combo. I like the backlighting of this pic but that''s about it. The tall crop makes it look like a long focal length and that you where just pervn on these girls. Best of luck. Scott</td>', 'Hooker heals and hot pink what a combo. I like the backlighting of this pic but that''s about it. The tall crop makes it look like a long focal length and that you where just pervn on these girls. Best of luck. Scott', '2008-07-29 22:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4850145, 700239, 24896, '<td valign="top">You got a little motion blur going here, and not really enough of it to make it look creative. The flame is really overexposed and I think your white balance is way off too. I don''t expect this will do too well (sorry). If you have questions or comments please PM me. Best of luck. Scott</td>', 'You got a little motion blur going here, and not really enough of it to make it look creative. The flame is really overexposed and I think your white balance is way off too. I don''t expect this will do too well (sorry). If you have questions or comments please PM me. Best of luck. Scott', '2008-07-29 22:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4850179, 702083, 24896, '<td valign="top">Great shape to the flame...it''s just too bad nothing is in focus</td>', 'Great shape to the flame...it''s just too bad nothing is in focus', '2008-07-29 23:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4850203, 701370, 24896, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Looks like you could have used a little rotation and if you crop out half the water would end up with a clearer division of thirds. It would also add a little needed width to this pic. Best of luck. Scott</td>', 'Nice capture. Looks like you could have used a little rotation and if you crop out half the water would end up with a clearer division of thirds. It would also add a little needed width to this pic. Best of luck. Scott', '2008-07-29 23:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
