(4850489, 701141, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol i see nothing "cool" about this photo.  I get a very warm feeling of it with the gold and red tones.  I like how the clouds look like a blanket.  Beautiful capture!</td>', 'lol i see nothing "cool" about this photo.  I get a very warm feeling of it with the gold and red tones.  I like how the clouds look like a blanket.  Beautiful capture!', '2008-07-30 01:23:26.000000', NULL, 0),
