(4850509, 702086, 67697, '<td valign="top">Some people must have some crazy cell phones out there hehehehe.  I already commented on the noise but I really think you have a good stock piece here.  Great lighting and set-up.</td>', 'Some people must have some crazy cell phones out there hehehehe.  I already commented on the noise but I really think you have a good stock piece here.  Great lighting and set-up.', '2008-07-30 01:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
