(4850558, 701901, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the way the peppers are cracked. For some reason, that makes them look really hot. I wonder if the smoke would have shown up better on a black background? Black would have eliminated the shadows that seem to have distracted some of the voters.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-30 00:39:54.</i></td>', 'I like the way the peppers are cracked. For some reason, that makes them look really hot. I wonder if the smoke would have shown up better on a black background? Black would have eliminated the shadows that seem to have distracted some of the voters.', '2008-07-30 01:38:14.000000', '2008-07-30 01:39:54.000000', 0),
