(4853897, 701735, 45475, '<td valign="top">Came back to see if you''d left any notes and to add to faves. I knew it had to have been a statue or cut-out, but I was more taken with what you captured in the sky. Thought it may have been a very clever ''cover-the-lens'' long exposure deal, but I''m still very much impressed just the same. Double congrats for your excellent pp work on it!</td>', 'Came back to see if you''d left any notes and to add to faves. I knew it had to have been a statue or cut-out, but I was more taken with what you captured in the sky. Thought it may have been a very clever ''cover-the-lens'' long exposure deal, but I''m still very much impressed just the same. Double congrats for your excellent pp work on it!', '2008-07-31 19:52:03.000000', NULL, 0),
