(4854900, 701899, 24486, '<td valign="top">I think you were a little hard done by with the 1''s, 2''s &amp; 3''s. I can''t believe you got so many with this photograph.</td>', 'I think you were a little hard done by with the 1''s, 2''s & 3''s. I can''t believe you got so many with this photograph.', '2008-08-01 04:45:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4855349, 700164, 67258, '<td valign="top">Kashi, I didn''t vote on this challenge, but having seen this photo in a recent forum thread I had to leave a comment.  I think it absolutely delightful and perfectly epitomises those long, hot summer days of childhood.  really lovely.</td>', 'Kashi, I didn''t vote on this challenge, but having seen this photo in a recent forum thread I had to leave a comment.  I think it absolutely delightful and perfectly epitomises those long, hot summer days of childhood.  really lovely.', '2008-08-01 09:42:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4855385, 700164, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lea, this is simply gorgeous.  Beautiful work.</td>', 'Lea, this is simply gorgeous.  Beautiful work.', '2008-08-01 10:04:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4855402, 701720, 93756, '<td valign="top">I think there are people who love pet pictures and people who are tired of them -probably the same with kids, bugs, and flowers. For a pet photo to do well, it has to be really superior. I gave you a 5 because it was a nicely composed photo and fit the challenge but didn''t "grab" me with a wow factor.</td>', 'I think there are people who love pet pictures and people who are tired of them -probably the same with kids, bugs, and flowers. For a pet photo to do well, it has to be really superior. I gave you a 5 because it was a nicely composed photo and fit the challenge but didn''t "grab" me with a wow factor.', '2008-08-01 10:09:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4856414, 701463, 16230, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot Gaurawa! It''s interesting that you were able to get this close with an ultra-wide angle lens. Didn''t he mind you sitting on his shoulders? :D<br/> <br/>My only nitpick is the composition. It''s a little too tight on the left. I''d like to see a more space between the front tire and the left edge of the photo. However, with a shot framed this tight, that''s a minor thing.<br/> <br/>Congrats!</td>', 'Excellent shot Gaurawa! It''s interesting that you were able to get this close with an ultra-wide angle lens. Didn''t he mind you sitting on his shoulders? :D My only nitpick is the composition. It''s a little too tight on the left. I''d like to see a more space between the front tire and the left edge of the photo. However, with a shot framed this tight, that''s a minor thing. Congrats!', '2008-08-01 13:35:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4856462, 702011, 15711, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful and I like the perspective. Congrats.</td>', 'Quite beautiful and I like the perspective. Congrats.', '2008-08-01 14:02:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4856608, 701883, 20577, '<td valign="top">I feel a little embarassed that mine finished above this. This should have ribboned.</td>', 'I feel a little embarassed that mine finished above this. This should have ribboned.', '2008-08-01 14:52:58.000000', NULL, 0),
