(4907729, 701688, 49804, '<td valign="top">This would benefit from a better layout of the candles, it seems like you just place them at random, maybe try lining up from tallest to shortest or vice versa. Different things like that can add a lot. Also a faster shutter speed could help. I''d like to see it a bit darker so that the flames aren''t blown out. Just my advice. Interesting idea though.</td>', 'This would benefit from a better layout of the candles, it seems like you just place them at random, maybe try lining up from tallest to shortest or vice versa. Different things like that can add a lot. Also a faster shutter speed could help. I''d like to see it a bit darker so that the flames aren''t blown out. Just my advice. Interesting idea though.', '2008-08-24 13:50:01.000000', NULL, 0),
