(5160179, 701772, 16197, '<td valign="top">I guess for me, it just doesn''t feel hot.  The blue of the sky is a cooler colour by nature and the tans of the sand and structure are not warm enough to compensate. Personally it looks more comfortable than hot.  Not that it wasn''t, but it just doesn''t appear to me that it was.</td>', 'I guess for me, it just doesn''t feel hot.  The blue of the sky is a cooler colour by nature and the tans of the sand and structure are not warm enough to compensate. Personally it looks more comfortable than hot.  Not that it wasn''t, but it just doesn''t appear to me that it was.', '2008-12-31 14:03:24.000000', NULL, 0),
